Package: nvfanread
Version: 1.0.0
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Evan Hoffman <evandhoffman@gmail.com>
Depends: dkms, kmod, make, gcc, libc6-dev
Description: DGX Spark read-only fan-RPM hwmon driver (DKMS)
 Reads fan tachometer telemetry from the DGX Spark EC over FF-A and exposes it
 as a hwmon device (fan1_input / fan2_input), so lm-sensors and node_exporter
 report fan RPM. Read-only: it never writes an EC override slot. The module is
 built and signed (with the machine's enrolled MOK) via DKMS at install time,
 and auto-loads at boot.
